### Get seller by ID (Public with optional authentication)
# This endpoint returns seller information including store statistics
# If authenticated, includes follow status and follow details
GET {{baseUrl}}/seller/{{sellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json

### Get seller by ID (Authenticated - includes follow status)
GET {{baseUrl}}/seller/{{sellerId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Follow seller
POST {{baseUrl}}/seller/{{sellerId}}/follow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Unfollow seller
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/seller/{{sellerId}}/follow
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### Get seller followers (Public)
GET {{baseUrl}}/seller/{{sellerId}}/followers?page=1&limit=20
Content-Type: application/json

### Get sellers I'm following (Private)
GET {{baseUrl}}/seller/following?page=1&limit=20
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

